  "title": "What is Metrology and How is it Used in Manufacturing?",
  "summary": "As products become more detailed and the limits of efficiency get pushed to new extremes, the manufacturing space has shifted toward ever-tighter tolerances to keep up. That sort of precision has become commonplace in modern products. However, achieving this level of precision is only the first step; tolerances need to be measured and verified through metrology. This article will explain what metrology is and why it is so critical to the manufacturing industry.",
